              21079,
              54659,
              149461
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M2",
            "speaker_id": 11765,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "The dust is the worst. It gets everywhere, even on the benches where I need to prep the PCBs. And people leave construction materials in the main walkway.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "dust",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M3",
            "speaker_id": 54659,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "My main issue is access. The path to the outdoor area gets blocked by deliveries for the construction team. It makes moving soil and larger plants difficult. Also, there's no good spot for washing tools without making a mess near the main entrance.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "seedling",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M4",
            "speaker_id": 149461,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Yeah, the dust is bad. And finding the right tools takes a while.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M5",
            "speaker_id": 237414,
            "reply_to": "M2",
            "text": "Good point on the dust, @11765. That's a top priority. My initial thought in A1 is a semi-enclosed, positive-pressure corner for PCB work. We can discuss the specifics in T2.",
            "mentions": [
              11765
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1",
              "T2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M6",
            "speaker_id": 237414,
            "reply_to": "M3",
            "text": "Thanks, @54659. We absolutely need a clear, designated route for garden access. I'll mark that in the draft. Your task T4 will be key to defining that. A dedicated wash-down station near the garden access point makes sense too.",
            "mentions": [
              54659
