            "artifact_refs": [
              "T4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M7",
            "speaker_id": 11765,
            "reply_to": "M5",
            "text": "What's positive pressure?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M8",
            "speaker_id": 21079,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Apologies for the delay. My main concern is the material flow for T1. The current layout forces us to lift heavy beams over active work areas. We need a clear crane path from the loading bay directly to the construction prep zone, with no cross-traffic. This is a major safety risk right now.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "warning",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M9",
            "speaker_id": 237414,
            "reply_to": "M7",
            "text": "It means we pump filtered air into the space, so air flows out and dust can't get in. We can detail that in T2.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "thumbsup",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M10",
            "speaker_id": 237414,
            "reply_to": "M8",
            "text": "Excellent point, @21079. That's a critical safety issue. I've updated A1 to reflect a protected crane corridor. This reinforces the need for strict zoning.",
            "mentions": [
              21079
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
