            "speaker_id": 237414,
            "reply_to": "M13",
            "text": "Okay, based on this, it seems we're converging on four main zones: 1. Construction Prep (heavy, dusty work), 2. PCB Prep (clean area), 3. Garden Tools (wet/dirty tools and materials), and 4. a shared Loading/Staging zone with a protected crane path. Does everyone agree with this high-level split?",
