            "speaker_id": 237414,
            "reply_to": "M44",
            "text": "Absolutely. Added it to the weekly section in A2. Thanks @21079. Now, related to this is T11, setting up record-keeping. I've created a simple template for a daily log in A6. It has three columns: 'Task Completed', 'Blockers/Issues', and 'Safety Observations/Incidents'. The idea is for each team to add a quick note at the end of their day.",
